ug(\"text {}\", var)`\n- Rewrites `log.h` / `log.cpp` around `std::format_string<Args...>` \u2014 removes the `LogDetailed` RAII class entirely\n- Converts all 1,420 call sites across 124 files (script-assisted)\n- Replaces `std::setw`/`std::setprecision`/`std::fixed` chains with format specifiers (`{:.1f}`, `{:6.2f}`)\n- Fixes two C++20 deprecation warnings: explicit `[=, this]` capture and float/enum comparison\n\nRequires GCC \u2265 13 / Clang \u2265 14 / MSVC 2019 16.10+ (all current CI targets meet this).\n\n## Test plan\n- [ ] CI green on Ubuntu 24.04 (GCC 13)\n- [ ] CI green on macOS\n- [ ] CI green on Windows (MSVC)\n- [ ] musl / Debian build green\n\n\ud83e\udd16 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)", "reactions": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/bansiesta/MAVSDK/issues/2/reactions", "total_count": 0, "+1": 0, "-1": 0, "laugh": 0, "hooray": 0, "confused": 0, "heart": 0, "rocket": 0, "eyes": 0}, "timeline_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/bansiesta/MAVSDK/issues/2/timeline", "performed_via_github_app": null, "state_reason": null}}, "event": "cross-referenced"}, {"actor": {"login": "bansiesta", "id": 10187973, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjEwMTg3OTcz", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10187973?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/bansiesta", "html_url": "https://github.com/bansiesta", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/bansiesta/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/bansiesta/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/bansiesta/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/bansiesta/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/bansiesta/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/bansiesta/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/bansiesta/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/bansiesta/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.